      <title>Codeberg's domain suddenly disappeared from their account, site is unreachable</title>
      <link>https://social.anoxinon.de/@Codeberg/117636454915265360</link>
      <guid>https://lobste.rs/s/spmgsd</guid>
      <author>social.anoxinon.de via mort</author>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:51:09 -0600</pubDate>
      <comments>https://lobste.rs/s/spmgsd/codeberg_s_domain_suddenly_disappeared</comments>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;del&gt;Note: codeberg's servers are up, it's just the domain that's gone. It works perfectly after adding the following line to &lt;code&gt;/etc/hosts&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;217.197.84.140 codeberg.org
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update: it's now up again, and the above workaround is not necessary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://lobste.rs/s/spmgsd/codeberg_s_domain_suddenly_disappeared"&gt;Comments&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
